   de Mexico; Universidad Nacional Autonoma de Mexico},
ORCID-Numbers = {Siebe, Christina/0000-0002-2636-6778},
Funding-Acknowledgement = {PEMEX},
Funding-Text = {This study was part of a larger investigation on the contribution of
   petroleum extraction and refining to environmental pollution in the
   state of Tabasco. It was financed by PEMEX and coordinated by Guillermo
   Calderon from the Instituto Mexicano del Petroleo (IMP). Rufino Lozano
   Santa Cruz helped with the XRFA analysis, Carlos Linares Lopez assisted
