Abstract = {The portal ``Cibergenetica{''} (http://cibergenetica.fciencias.unam.mx)
   was prepared with the objective of integrating in a single place,
   resources, news and updated information which serve to improve the
   process of teaching and learning the subject of Genetics at the Faculty
   of Sciences of the National Autonomous University of Mexico. The portal
   provides a useful tool to encourage students to deepen the themes seen
   in class. The portal is based on Joomla, a content management system
   widely used for its ease, its interactivity and global reach. The portal
   has the following sections: blogs, members, societies and events,
   disclosure and dissemination, links, courses, books, and glossary. The
   information that appears on the cover and disclosure is managed with a
   subscription to ensure that it's up-to-date at all times. Students show
   great acceptance of the portal because they believe that it is a good
   tool for learning genetics.},
