Abstract = {Strepsylla Traub, 1950 is considered a New World flea genus,
   parasitizing, in most cases, species of Muridae, particularly
   peromyscines. Thirteen species of Strepsylla are addressed with respect
   to their taxonomic characters, host preferences and geographic
