   (ICTA2009), Hacettepe Univ, Dept Math, Ankara, TURKEY, JUL 06-11, 2009},
Organization = {Sci \& Technol Res Council Turkey; Ihsan Dogramaci Fdn},
Abstract = {In this paper. for G a locally compact group (or a Lie group), we study
   the relationship between the covering dimensions of a proper G-space X
   and its orbit space X/G. We prove also that dim X = Ind X for every
   proper G-space X with a metrizable orbit space provided that G is either
   pro-Lie or a-compact or has a metrizable quotient group of connected
   components. (C) 2011 Elsevier B.V. All rights reserved.},
