   importance of the art of governing with base on two fundamental
   approaches for the communitarian life, such as social sciences and
   public policies, which contribute with theoretical, methodological and
   heuristic elements related to the capacities of direction and
   implementation which are due to produce and to develop in order to
   assure, in the scope of increasing complexities, the conditions that
